  "notes": "Zoo 0.91.0. A bar's wall dartboard cabinet: bristle board on felt, two chalkboard doors with a cricket grid and a dart rail each, brass hinges, a chalk tray. Planned in core/dartboard_forms.py, painted in core/dartboard_art.py (board sectors, rings and numbers at regulation radii; the chalk marks a game in progress per variant). Brands are INVENTED (dartboard_art.BRANDS), never a real dart maker; the lettering is Pixel Operator, CC0, via Pixelcoat. The slot is the OPEN footprint (the doors' free edges); collision is the cabinet box only. The bull is at the slot's centre height. The back is the slot's +Y face."
